              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"a)\">Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"4\\cos^{2} x=t\"></span>,  тогда имеем:<center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(3-t)} (9-t^{2})=2+\\frac{1}{\\log_2 (3-t)}\\iff \\log_{(3-t)} ((3-t)(3+t))=2+\\log_{(3-t)} 2\\iff 1+\\log_{(3-t)} (3+t)=2+\\log_{(3-t)} 2\\iff \\log_{(3-t)} \\frac{3+t}{2}=1\\iff \\begin{cases}\\frac{3+t}{2}=3-t\\\\3-t\\gt 0\\\\3-t\\ne 1\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff t=1\"></span>. </span></p><p><span></span></p></center><p>Вернёмся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"4\\cos^{2} x=1\\iff \\cos x=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}\\iff x=\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0e1261c6-01ce-4cb3-b10b-5798ff5933f3\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/0e1261c6-01ce-4cb3-b10b-5798ff5933f3\"/></p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">При по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти отберём корни, ле­жа­щие на  от­рез­ке  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{\\pi}{3};\\frac{2\\pi}{3}]\"></span> .  По­лу­ча­ем числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\,\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\,\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
